@crew teshavi
// Writer (command: guests), batch 3b. Speaker Teshavi: grave, slow, ceremonial; long silences.

== greet
? tier=stranger
- Greetings. I am Teshavi, who speaks for the council. You may speak to me. Briefly is fine.
- Good day, cadet. Your ship is very loud. It is a cheerful kind of loud.   #funny
? tier>=acquaintance
- Good day, {me}. You are the one Saruth mentioned. Saruth mentions few.   #warm
== feel
? mood:high
- The talks go well. The tea goes better.   #funny
? mood:low
- A long day of words. I will have a long hour of none.
== near
? deck:3 act:free
- Your garden is small and very busy. Like your people.
? place:calm
- Sit. We need not speak. Among my people, this is a fine conversation.   #funny
== life
? tier>=acquaintance
- I brought your Captain a gift in seven knots. No, I will not say what is inside.   #funny
